# Temp files

Write generated, disposable files only under `.temp/` at the repo root. Do not put them in the project root, `src/`, `content/`, `public/`, or `.playwright-cli/`.

This includes screenshots, Playwright snapshots, YAML dumps, console logs, PDFs, scratch notes, and other artifacts created while debugging or verifying.

```text
# ❌ BAD
live-homepage.png
.playwright-cli/page-….yml
/tmp-check.html

# ✅ GOOD
.temp/live-homepage.png
.temp/page-homepage.yml
.temp/check.html
```

Create `.temp/` if it does not exist. Do not commit it.
